# Each UI test's slowest pass in CI, in seconds, as device|Class/test<TAB>seconds (gatefold#260). A shard's limit in
# .github/workflows/app.yml is 30 min of setup, twice what its tests add up to here, 5 for the test run's start and
# stop, and 12 for the logs; scripts/ci-shards.py check fails when a timeout or its comment doesn't match, and names
# the line to write. "Slowest" is the 95th percentile of the test's passing or skipped times in the App runs of pull
# requests and main from 42938568336 to 43280151381 (2026-11-08 to 11-12, 176 runs, runner load up to 800), so one
# freak run doesn't set it; the slowest single pass is noted after it. A new test needs a line: its slowest pass so
# far, or an estimate until CI has run it. Notes after the seconds are ignored.
